[4743]={["aftermath"]="Vaelan completed a protective invocation and promised the red flight's aid in a desperate hour. The promise was not itself a recorded intervention.",["atomIDs"]={"4743:description:1-132","4743:description:134-195","4743:description:200-250","4743:description:252-320","4743:description:322-349","4743:description:351-397","4743:description:399-490","4743:objective:1-42","4743:objective:44-131","4743:objective:136-231","4743:objective:233-355","4743:objective:357-457"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4743:completion:1-61","4743:completion:66-108","4743:completion:113-148","4743:completion:153-226","4743:completion:228-331"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Force Emberstrife's breath to forge the seal in Dustwallow's Wyrmbog.",["opening"]="Wyrmthalak could forge the seal but would not submit to control. Vaelan instead directed the attempt toward the ancient Emberstrife, whose weakened will could briefly be mastered with a draconic orb long enough to heat the artifact.",["pending"]="{actor} would use Emberstrife's flames to forge the seal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned after forging the seal with Emberstrife's breath.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="7711c9fce37046cb3229b33bcd16979cc053a307c2de1e918979fb3ddd4641b9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4761]={["atomIDs"]={"4761:description:1-98","4761:description:101-224","4761:description:227-297","4761:description:302-379","4761:description:382-465","4761:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Terenthis wanted Auberdine's elder to hear the furbolg findings. Thundris might have ideas about the corruption and a way of restoring balance beyond another attack on the camp.",["pending"]="{actor} would share the furbolg findings with Thundris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Thundris Windweaver about the furbolg situation.",["sourceHash"]="e71c37cf056de84b497bf9d763716b32877507b1a7166f84d8f0e2cdf5fd6659",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4762]={["atomIDs"]={"4762:description:1-59","4762:description:62-141","4762:description:144-269","4762:description:274-343","4762:description:346-421","4762:description:424-452","4762:description:455-504","4762:objective:1-115","4762:objective:120-196"},["opening"]="The Cliffspring River was turning foul, threatening the water reaching Auberdine. Thundris suspected the upstream Blackwood furbolgs without believing they were the ultimate cause; a sample below the first waterfall could test the taint.",["pending"]="{actor} would draw the Cliffspring River Sample beneath the bridge and return to Thundris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Cliffspring River Sample to Thundris Windweaver.",["sourceHash"]="86a695beb4f205510af4889fdd3dadeb3613a37374e0fcd0c5b77d45128f82c3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4763]={["aftermath"]="Thundris treated the result as a battle won at the beginning of a larger struggle. The cleansing offered hope for a lasting release of the furbolgs, without yet establishing that it had been achieved.",["atomIDs"]={"4763:description:1-68","4763:description:71-131","4763:description:134-236","4763:description:241-335","4763:description:338-479","4763:description:481-503","4763:objective:1-56","4763:objective:61-143","4763:objective:148-280","4763:objective:285-365"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4763:completion:1-116","4763:completion:118-206","4763:completion:208-248","4763:completion:250-359"},["opening"]="Thundris traced the corruption to a satyr working through a talisman. Moonwell water mixed with the furbolgs' own food might briefly cleanse them and draw their corrupter out beside the river bonfire.",["pending"]="{actor} would prepare the cleansing bowl, lure out the corruptor and recover its talisman for Thundris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the cleansing-bowl assignment and delivered the Talisman of Corruption to Thundris.",["sourceHash"]="07ade58cf6d59605518f5a5cf692879f299efcf242d5f8677277fd1922572fdd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4764]={["aftermath"]="Mayara saw the clasp as confirmation of the rumors and anticipated Count Remington Ridgewell's pleasure at the addition to his collection.",["atomIDs"]={"4764:description:1-86","4764:description:89-170","4764:description:175-192","4764:description:195-250","4764:description:252-269","4764:description:272-334","4764:description:339-477","4764:description:482-510","4764:objective:1-69"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4764:completion:1-13","4764:completion:15-38","4764:completion:43-56","4764:completion:58-157"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Doomrigger's Clasp from Blackrock Spire for Mayara.",["opening"]="A chamber once called the Hall of Fortune had held Dark Iron relics and art. Mayara believed its ruined remains still concealed Doomrigger's gem-encrusted clasp, a prize sought for her patron's collection.",["pending"]="{actor} would search the former Hall of Fortune for the clasp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} recovered Doomrigger's Clasp for Mayara.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="999b37deffa1731cce5ec320f350918422fd98a89a381acdda6b39991b5e8b94",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4765]={["aftermath"]="Ridgewell thanked the courier and stressed the value of his family's gratitude.",["atomIDs"]={"4765:description:1-83","4765:description:86-157","4765:description:162-208","4765:description:211-253","4765:description:256-316","4765:objective:1-60"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4765:completion:1-18","4765:completion:20-42","4765:completion:44-49","4765:completion:51-79","4765:completion:81-161"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Deliver Mayara's crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind Keep.",["opening"]="Doomrigger's Clasp had been packed for the journey to Stormwind. Mayara's remaining request was to place the recovered artwork in the hands of the noble whose collection had prompted the expedition.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver the crate to Ridgewell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Mayara's crate to Remington Ridgewell.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0d80cf62d01233ce9b8357605fd38d22591043dbd2121758cf8a18f5115981af",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4766]={["aftermath"]="Mayara confirmed that she knew of a work of art coveted for Remington's museum, but warned that extracting it would be difficult.",["atomIDs"]={"4766:description:1-108","4766:description:111-189","4766:description:191-243","4766:description:248-343","4766:description:346-400","4766:description:405-495","4766:objective:1-52"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4766:completion:1-24","4766:completion:26-146","4766:completion:151-175"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Meet Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.",["opening"]="Remington's agent Mayara had gone to investigate Thaurissan's ruins for valuable objects. Her discovery instead pointed into Blackrock Spire, and recovering it required someone willing to undertake that further journey.",["pending"]="{actor} would hear Mayara's findings in the Burning Steppes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Mayara after the referral from Stormwind.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="4982204e67f6a999914831f412c903afffb34e98adb4d99ba2f32d99cc1ebe89",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4767]={["aftermath"]="Elu hoped the eggs would bring him another step toward becoming a wind rider.",["atomIDs"]={"4767:description:1-68","4767:description:70-144","4767:description:146-212","4767:description:214-241","4767:description:246-306","4767:description:308-400","4767:description:402-496","4767:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4767:completion:1-8","4767:completion:10-77","4767:completion:79-157"},["opening"]="Demand for trained wyverns had outrun the available mounts. Elu sought eggs from Highperch while hoping to become a wind rider himself.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten Highperch eggs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the wyvern eggs to Elu.",["sourceHash"]="bfe09bb699685da4bacb62ac582e292690c4641968aa7585deb522489f1846f7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4768]={["aftermath"]="Vivian anticipated days of work deciphering the formulae and hoped the research would prove valuable.",["atomIDs"]={"4768:description:1-80","4768:description:83-194","4768:description:199-330","4768:description:333-401","4768:description:406-509","4768:objective:1-68"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4768:completion:1-10","4768:completion:12-134","4768:completion:139-152","4768:completion:154-184"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Urheld Darkstone's tablet from Blackrock Spire for Vivian.",["opening"]="Urheld's contemporaries had dismissed the skilled alchemist as mad, leaving his research concealed in tablets rather than openly shared. Vivian believed one survived in the former Hall of Fortune and wanted its formulae recovered for study.",["pending"]="{actor} would search the ruined hall for Darkstone's tablet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Darkstone Tablet to Vivian.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0fd4111f1bab7fdf9479cb2731e14c1688dcb11fa6b23c39d8872bb6673b470d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4769]={["aftermath"]="Vivian explained that she sought a tablet of old alchemical recipes and needed help retrieving it.",["atomIDs"]={"4769:description:1-58","4769:description:61-174","4769:description:177-250","4769:description:253-265","4769:description:270-318","4769:objective:1-37"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4769:completion:1-11","4769:completion:13-115","4769:completion:117-181","4769:completion:186-239"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath about the Darkstone Tablet.",["opening"]="Vivian's studies pointed to an ancient text within Blackrock Spire that might advance the research. Before anyone could retrieve it, the search required hearing her findings in Kargath.",["pending"]="{actor} would consult Vivian about the text in Blackrock Spire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e41fbb2c0deab3d36a5862ce4adfd3a9c7ba3257c9d03fa6f27552f658dc6d60",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4770]={["aftermath"]="Motega acknowledged the rescue and his responsibility for the younger researcher.",["atomIDs"]={"4770:description:1-19","4770:description:21-124","4770:description:126-194","4770:description:196-252","4770:description:257-294","4770:description:296-403","4770:description:408-446","4770:description:448-468","4770:objective:1-96"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4770:completion:1-6","4770:completion:8-116","4770:completion:118-191","4770:completion:193-273","4770:completion:278-321","4770:completion:323-380"},["opening"]="Pao'ka had approached a wyvern nest too closely and lost his way after being chased. He sought a protected return to Motega at Whitereach.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to escort Pao'ka out of Highperch.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the escort and reported to Motega.",["sourceHash"]="27190c3eaf955922a54752cbe4e1d735c18fb46b3816d9d75e591d84ad051427",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4771]={["aftermath"]="Betina welcomed Vectus's defeat but questioned whether the invention had worked as hoped. Victory did not establish that the device destroyed the scholars as intended.",["atomIDs"]={"4771:description:1-96","4771:description:99-150","4771:description:155-212","4771:description:214-364","4771:description:369-420","4771:description:423-428","4771:objective:1-59","4771:objective:62-109"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4771:completion:1-11","4771:completion:13-31","4771:completion:33-52","4771:completion:54-65","4771:completion:76-174","4771:completion:176-189","4771:completion:194-259"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Place Dawn's Gambit in the Viewing Room and defeat Vectus.",["opening"]="Betina had concealed a device inside the container once used for dragon eggs. Taking it to Vectus's scholarly chamber in Scholomance was intended to destroy the gathered undead and make the mage easier to confront.",["pending"]="{actor} would deploy the device among Vectus's scholars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Vectus and reported to Betina.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="2720802a35be93c0835fabb295d9fd59f75831c7529d958829198cc756d151ff",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4781]={["aftermath"]="Xizk needed time to spin the thread. His tale about a princess confined to that work was a joke he immediately withdrew.",["atomIDs"]={"4781:description:1-80","4781:description:85-212","4781:description:214-323","4781:description:328-376","4781:description:378-444","4781:description:446-485","4781:description:487-507","4781:objective:1-58"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4781:completion:1-12","4781:completion:14-72","4781:completion:74-106","4781:completion:108-136","4781:completion:138-173","4781:completion:178-360","4781:completion:362-375","4781:completion:377-388","4781:completion:390-406"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring a gold bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay.",["opening"]="Menara needed rare gold thread for the robe's embroidery. Xizk, a tailor loyal to the same cause, knew how to make it if supplied with a bar obtained through skilled mining and smelting.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain gold and take it to Xizk.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Xizk with the gold bar.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="10310f5356b1d8fe50acd88cbf1615b9f840a02b287276f43c36f96a6938d9ef",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4782]={["aftermath"]="Menara trusted the goblin and his brother to fulfill the promise and turned to the remaining materials.",["atomIDs"]={"4782:description:1-94","4782:description:96-103","4782:description:105-209","4782:description:211-245","4782:description:250-263","4782:description:265-319","4782:description:321-336","4782:description:338-383","4782:description:385-390","4782:objective:1-43"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4782:completion:1-26","4782:completion:28-51","4782:completion:56-72","4782:completion:74-92","4782:completion:94-219","4782:completion:233-286","4782:completion:291-325"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Tell Menara that Xizk's thread will take time.",["opening"]="The tailor could provide the gold thread but could not finish it immediately. Returning to Menara would allow the other components to be gathered while his work continued.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry Xizk's message back to Menara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} told Menara about the delay.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="04eb297fa7e28353732fc4d59abbf368cdf00cb9620115fbbed93c176650626d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4783]={["aftermath"]="Menara began preparing the materials while directing the search toward the robe's last components.",["atomIDs"]={"4783:description:1-108","4783:description:113-158","4783:description:160-277","4783:description:282-344","4783:description:346-423","4783:description:428-477","4783:objective:1-97"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4783:completion:1-14","4783:completion:16-36","4783:completion:38-107","4783:completion:109-122"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Gather ten vials of Hatefury blood and a lesser infernal stone for Menara.",["opening"]="Menara's robe required materials from Desolace: blood from the Hatefury satyrs and a stone from the lesser infernals of Mannoroc Coven. The craft drew on the region's demonic dangers rather than ordinary cloth alone.",["pending"]="{actor} would collect the satyr blood and infernal stone in Desolace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the blood and stone to Menara.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e731cd075f46cdb4c7743118fdbe0c986a0bf4f28ebc2954183f38b40bfb53fa",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4784]={["aftermath"]="With the components assembled, Menara announced that the work was ready to begin.",["atomIDs"]={"4784:description:1-63","4784:description:68-118","4784:description:120-157","4784:description:162-248","4784:description:250-315","4784:description:320-356","4784:description:361-457","4784:objective:1-102"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4784:completion:1-14","4784:completion:16-60","4784:completion:65-92"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Menara the fine gold thread, two smoldering coals and a soul shard.",["opening"]="Only the final ingredients remained: Xizk's thread, coals from Arathi's fire elementals near Thoradin's Wall and a shard made by the intended wearer. Together they would allow Menara to finish the robe.",["pending"]="{actor} would assemble the last materials for Menara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the thread, coals and shard.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="3a4c40cdc8ebe108b5e4ae0cc97003bbea218d538a4f468cf1327269da825570",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4786]={["aftermath"]="Menara praised the work but returned to the danger of corruption: success depended on keeping one's will free.",["atomIDs"]={"4786:description:1-41","4786:description:43-73","4786:description:75-88","4786:objective:1-77"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4786:completion:1-15","4786:completion:17-29","4786:completion:31-49","4786:completion:54-110","4786:completion:112-200","4786:completion:202-269"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Wait for Menara to finish the robe and speak to her again.",["opening"]="The gathering was over and Menara needed only a few moments to assemble the garment. Remaining at the tower would bring the long preparation to its final conversation.",["pending"]="{actor} would wait while Menara completed the robe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Menara after the robe was completed.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="9f3345d68389e6db9458888be79c28b4c39fef5a2e991f26bfaa112936b7981b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4787]={["atomIDs"]={"4787:description:1-50","4787:description:53-159","4787:description:162-221","4787:description:226-254","4787:description:257-382","4787:objective:1-46"},["opening"]="Yeh'kinya interpreted the prophecy as requiring an ancient egg able to hold Hakkar's essence. He described it as a possible safeguard and placed its hiding place behind Jintha'Alor's amphitheater.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the egg for Yeh'kinya.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the ancient egg in Tanaris.",["sourceHash"]="2a28491591be75f7ab10dbf673c8001e7215170c3153e9c9efc1a2d145dceab6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4788]={["aftermath"]="Ironboot's reading of the earlier tablets had uncovered a coming danger. The recovered stones completed the search without yet resolving the threat.",["atomIDs"]={"4788:description:1-94","4788:description:97-185","4788:description:188-274","4788:description:279-292","4788:description:295-340","4788:objective:1-77"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4788:completion:1-13","4788:completion:16-30","4788:completion:33-57","4788:completion:62-170","4788:completion:172-222"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover the fifth and sixth Mosh'aru tablets from the Smolderthorn in Blackrock Spire.",["opening"]="Ironboot still studied the earlier Mosh'aru tablets, but two more remained with the Smolderthorn trolls in Blackrock Spire. Completing the text meant venturing into the mountain between the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek the remaining tablets among the Smolderthorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the fifth and sixth tablets to Ironboot.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="533bac36a0d3a4eec403b1ad794f18e71cc1a18bcdf7a006e9aa0cbf898a30da",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4808]={["aftermath"]="Felnok identified the requested engineering parts as his role in the proposed device.",["atomIDs"]={"4808:description:1-35","4808:description:40-163","4808:description:166-248","4808:description:251-298","4808:description:303-335","4808:description:338-362","4808:description:365-424","4808:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4808:completion:1-18","4808:completion:20-41","4808:completion:43-63","4808:completion:65-95","4808:completion:100-141","4808:completion:143-195","4808:completion:197-209","4808:completion:211-281","4808:completion:283-317"},["opening"]="Study of the essence suggested eggs might be frozen and preserved. Tinkee needed special parts from Felnok before she could test that theory.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take her letter to Everlook.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the request to Felnok.",["sourceHash"]="7449940a158c2854a03f8a5b8a35de7400093835b7e5a92cd1d5835ad602fd0a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4809]={["aftermath"]="Felnok put on gloves before packing them with the remaining components.",["atomIDs"]={"4809:description:1-102","4809:description:105-234","4809:description:237-291","4809:description:296-373","4809:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4809:completion:1-25","4809:completion:27-51","4809:completion:53-137"},["opening"]="Felnok had most of Tinkee's components but lacked a concentrated source of cold. Only intact chimaera horns would complete the order without losing the quality he needed.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect eight uncracked horns.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the chillwind horns.",["sourceHash"]="2cc9c8bd8cc9e9b0b3c38d337911fba5f1fd4887234c8a57ccbb48c7bc3d065d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4810]={["aftermath"]="Tinkee began preparing work with the parts and anticipated further tasks.",["atomIDs"]={"4810:description:1-62","4810:description:65-138","4810:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4810:completion:1-17","4810:completion:19-24","4810:completion:26-53","4810:completion:55-71","4810:completion:76-160"},["opening"]="Felnok's package was complete and ready to leave the snow. Tinkee awaited the components for the proposed dragon-egg device in the distant Steppes.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the package to Tinkee.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Felnok's shipment.",["sourceHash"]="cfd18b041d5eb9c87c946583d5462a0f19fa604eda87efdc6476663078cf170c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4811]={["atomIDs"]={"4811:description:1-60","4811:description:63-125","4811:description:128-239","4811:description:244-358","4811:description:361-430","4811:description:433-503","4811:objective:1-100","4811:objective:103-169"},["opening"]="Moonkin numbers were rising east of Auberdine, with reports drawing them toward a red crystal by the mountains. Glynda wanted its existence and nature investigated before speculation guided the village's response.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find the reported red crystal and tell Glynda what was there.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for the red crystal and reported to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea.",["sourceHash"]="3c94ed3de3f118e8de0eef1771970258eec466af8f1e42e8eaae99ff60c599c6",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4812]={["atomIDs"]={"4812:description:1-73","4812:description:76-152","4812:description:155-239","4812:description:244-330","4812:description:333-464","4812:objective:1-130"},["opening"]="Glynda proposed moonwell water as a test of the crystal's composition. She suspected a connection to Felwood above the eastern mountains and cautioned that the experiment might be dangerous.",["pending"]="{actor} would fill the Water Tube at Auberdine's moonwell and investigate the crystal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the moonwell-water investigation at the red crystal.",["sourceHash"]="93898aa7431d593bbb8a7afa81b70d4c84d72ed4876c8f07d5b467e5759428ab",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4813]={["aftermath"]="Glynda planned to bring the findings to Auberdine's council. The crystal had yielded evidence, but also more questions; no definite course of action had been settled.",["atomIDs"]={"4813:description:1-129","4813:description:132-295","4813:description:300-407","4813:objective:1-73"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4813:completion:1-111","4813:completion:116-191","4813:completion:193-258","4813:completion:260-377","4813:completion:382-410","4813:completion:412-456"},["opening"]="The water had revealed small bones and half a jaw embedded in the crystal. The jaw might be humanoid, but the crystal could not readily be broken to confirm that impression; the findings had to return to Glynda.",["pending"]="{actor} would report the crystal's embedded fragments to Glynda.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the fragments found inside the red crystal to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea.",["sourceHash"]="e6d44aa8a500ef3b5488e91dfbb1c5e43a272084065be082e0ef3cbd43a1445b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4821]={["atomIDs"]={"4821:description:1-65","4821:description:67-161","4821:description:163-213","4821:description:218-299","4821:description:301-459","4821:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Reports described an unusual egg guarded by serpents, but no witness had examined it closely. Hagar wanted it brought from one of the cliffside dens.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the reported egg for Hagar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the mysterious egg to Hagar.",["sourceHash"]="286d2376770df329b0f0e12152bdb26bc2dd050b9745fde2bad884f637ec09e3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4822]={["aftermath"]="The delighted child thanked the escort for the treat.",["atomIDs"]={"4822:description:1-10","4822:description:13-69","4822:description:72-206","4822:description:209-259","4822:description:264-396","4822:description:399-405","4822:description:408-421","4822:description:424-479","4822:objective:1-44","4822:objective:47-105"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4822:completion:1-10","4822:completion:12-45","4822:completion:47-116","4822:completion:121-173"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring the orphan ward some Tigule and Foror strawberry ice cream.",["opening"]="The ward remembered a favorite treat from the Shimmering Flats race track and hoped it could now be bought in town. A request for strawberry ice cream offered a small pleasure amid the child's outing.",["pending"]="{actor} would find the ward's favorite strawberry ice cream.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the requested ice cream to the ward.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="435ec3841922ed17911f85ef16bbad05c6d07f28ffcbd53a8210d602d9c80a2d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4841]={["atomIDs"]={"4841:description:1-45","4841:description:47-87","4841:description:89-142","4841:description:145-170","4841:objective:1-125"},["opening"]="Longhorn's answer to the caravan raid was retaliation against the Galak camp north of Freewind. Scouts, wranglers and windchasers were his named targets.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry out Longhorn's Galak assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment and returned to Freewind.",["sourceHash"]="077fb2f92a740b8812083ba62ee3e0ff63858a6e52571014a95ef9b7cec9e839",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4842]={["aftermath"]="Donova attributed the change in the land to the gorge's demons and resolved to continue observing the springs.",["atomIDs"]={"4842:description:1-155","4842:description:160-208","4842:description:210-286","4842:description:288-418","4842:description:423-434","4842:description:436-487","4842:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4842:completion:1-114","4842:completion:116-202","4842:completion:207-304"},["opening"]="Donova doubted the hot springs had a volcanic origin. She sent the investigation south through the snowy region toward darkened skies and thick air where she believed a more dangerous source would be found.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to inspect the southern source and report back.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned with the findings.",["sourceHash"]="f17228e2cd09f1edd620c2b396fe7c9b8421cb570c76985233a878bec5122493",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4861]={["aftermath"]="One severely damaged crate stood out amid the destroyed possessions.",["atomIDs"]={"4861:description:1-23","4861:description:25-104","4861:description:106-176","4861:description:181-256","4861:description:258-316","4861:description:318-423","4861:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4861:completion:1-93"},["opening"]="Wildkin had driven Jaron from his camp after he approached something they guarded. He feared for a companion and wanted supplies and a newly unearthed amulet recovered.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to locate Jaron's wrecked camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the damaged campsite.",["sourceHash"]="da603e8f19151cf57463a5773eeb11e7b2248067a33e7c483842566289b91040",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4862]={["aftermath"]="Kibler expected a profitable sale and offered the promised domesticated creature in return.",["atomIDs"]={"4862:description:1-101","4862:description:106-224","4862:description:226-251","4862:description:256-278","4862:description:280-343","4862:description:345-447","4862:objective:1-70","4862:objective:75-133"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4862:completion:1-12","4862:completion:14-44","4862:completion:46-84","4862:completion:89-132","4862:completion:134-150"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Collect fifteen Spire spider eggs for Kibler.",["opening"]="Kibler believed even repulsive creatures could find wealthy buyers. Bijou had not returned from an egg-collecting commission, so he sought another collector for the spiders of Blackrock Spire.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover spider eggs for Kibler's exotic trade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned fifteen Spire spider eggs to Kibler.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="54e9a04378ca6afa7fda3b724f83d53ed7de7cb14224bf0bd5bb803a0aa1b605",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4863]={["aftermath"]="Undamaged crates remained half-buried in the snow near it.",["atomIDs"]={"4863:description:1-62","4863:description:64-186","4863:description:191-254","4863:description:256-299","4863:description:301-318","4863:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4863:completion:1-80","4863:completion:82-191"},["opening"]="The first crate appeared deliberately smashed rather than merely lost. A wagon visible eastward offered another place to search for what the camp no longer held.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to inspect Jaron's wrecked wagon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the abandoned wagon.",["sourceHash"]="6f06e81635edd74325de3f70bdbf56d4d4454bd6ca04912c029036eabff4fc6c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4864]={["aftermath"]="Jaron welcomed the tools and amulet but still wondered why the wildkin had defended that particular object.",["atomIDs"]={"4864:description:1-115","4864:description:117-156","4864:description:161-328","4864:objective:1-99","4864:objective:104-206"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4864:completion:1-38","4864:completion:40-105","4864:completion:110-169","4864:completion:171-228","4864:completion:230-290"},["opening"]="Useful tools survived in the box, but the amulet was absent. Wildkin to the north and east offered the next lead after the destroyed camp and wagon.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the amulet and bring back the supplies.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both to Jaron.",["sourceHash"]="e0257cd1433231624a282b3b78ec10f5042ddd93af7c380c024cad1ee2dd1f4f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4865]={["aftermath"]="Motega recognized the threat through the legend of Arikara and called for immediate action.",["atomIDs"]={"4865:description:1-81","4865:description:83-121","4865:description:126-148","4865:description:153-177","4865:description:179-295","4865:description:297-320","4865:objective:1-40"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4865:completion:1-10","4865:completion:12-45","4865:completion:47-106"},["opening"]="Hagar had witnessed something he could scarcely believe and called it vengeance. He sent the news to Motega for an urgent response.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take Hagar's findings to Motega.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the event at Whitereach.",["sourceHash"]="1340d5b63ae2fa6cf85ca8c1779dee4ae6e9f943697465e268770a4ab1cf1e61",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4866]={["aftermath"]="John revealed that he intended to use the extracted venom in ale rather than as a weapon.",["atomIDs"]={"4866:description:1-62","4866:description:67-152","4866:description:154-258","4866:description:263-349","4866:description:351-393","4866:description:395-436","4866:description:441-447","4866:description:449-465","4866:description:470-511","4866:objective:1-64","4866:objective:66-102","4866:objective:104-159","4866:objective:161-230"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4866:completion:1-36","4866:completion:41-88","4866:completion:90-110","4866:completion:115-127"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Return to Ragged John while carrying Mother Smolderweb's poison.",["opening"]="John's experiment required more than a spider gland: he wanted Smolderweb's venom circulating in a living carrier. His account of its terrible potency concealed the reason he wanted the sample extracted after the dangerous trip.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Smolderweb's poison and return to John while afflicted.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Ragged John with the requested poison sample.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="bd55edf2b2bb57b36c17895e15b944a04593fd0eb3dd5a9a23d8a276e3ab519b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4867]={["aftermath"]="Warosh felt his power returning and said Urok's curse no longer tormented his mind. He acknowledged the aid while doubting anyone could survive the ascent through Blackrock Spire.",["atomIDs"]={"4867:description:1-5","4867:description:8-24","4867:description:29-43","4867:description:46-60","4867:objective:1-21","4867:objective:24-53"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4867:completion:1-4","4867:completion:6-50","4867:completion:52-100","4867:completion:105-118","4867:completion:120-173","4867:completion:178-240","4867:completion:242-338"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Warosh's mojo and bring it back to him.",["opening"]="Warosh struggled to speak and passed over a scroll with a demand for his missing mojo. His urgent gestures left the written instructions to explain the recovery.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek the mojo Warosh needed.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} restored Warosh's mojo.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="eb144c15767e31e37d8f611e70e7d4b3e205ed7486cc45e2f52538baaaf70f91",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability","waroshScrollBody"}},
[4881]={["atomIDs"]={"4881:description:1-82","4881:description:84-152","4881:description:154-216","4881:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="The message planned Kanati's assassination to remove his hunting camp and discourage others. Its meeting point lay southwest of the Great Lift.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to warn Kanati about the plot.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the warning at Whitereach.",["sourceHash"]="4edb9001e277ebf3c8d238fec21067e9078d3ad773c0fd88aaf949ed2b9febd6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4882]={["atomIDs"]={"4882:description:1-105","4882:description:107-150","4882:description:155-252","4882:description:254-289","4882:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="The blue-feathered necklace glowed and faded in a steady rhythm. Its meaning remained uncertain, while Trull's knowledge of wildkin made him the first person to consult.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show the necklace to Trull.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the necklace at Bloodvenom.",["sourceHash"]="e237d432836f88b395454fba3c2afeaa3acb5d4d8b201e7affa029eed1d65a16",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4883]={["aftermath"]="Nara traced its energy to Elune and described the wildkin as creatures originally made to guard sacred places.",["atomIDs"]={"4883:description:1-146","4883:description:148-257","4883:description:262-328","4883:description:330-343","4883:objective:1-50"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4883:completion:1-32","4883:completion:34-71","4883:completion:76-124","4883:completion:129-186","4883:completion:188-237","4883:completion:239-321","4883:completion:326-404","4883:completion:409-432","4883:completion:434-471"},["opening"]="Trull distinguished knowledge of the creatures from knowledge of their magic. He referred the necklace to Nara's expertise rather than claiming he could explain it.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the necklace to Nara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it in Thunder Bluff.",["sourceHash"]="81bcbf5c62c43fb089ba6db19777bce1d16edc7f3dc2574348c0bbdd60c5e845",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4901]={["atomIDs"]={"4901:description:1-85","4901:description:87-210","4901:description:215-358","4901:description:360-425","4901:description:430-499","4901:objective:1-70","4901:objective:72-133"},["opening"]="Ranshalla believed the ridge's altar belonged to Elune. Torchlight and incantations copied from the ruins might restore access, provided she could be protected while reciting them.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to guard the altar working and report to Erelas.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Ranshalla's protection and delivered the findings.",["sourceHash"]="daa24aa274c4ae26b7fa64a13f645f6c5e41f11315fbadf812c07286037fb9be",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4902]={["aftermath"]="Fandral said the Circle already knew of the wildkin's sacred purpose but acknowledged the effort.",["atomIDs"]={"4902:description:1-19","4902:description:24-64","4902:description:66-113","4902:description:115-215","4902:description:217-275","4902:description:277-315","4902:description:320-353","4902:objective:1-52"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4902:completion:1-43","4902:completion:48-55","4902:completion:57-60","4902:completion:62-66","4902:completion:71-157","4902:completion:159-164","4902:completion:166-169","4902:completion:171-244","4902:completion:246-325","4902:completion:330-398","4902:completion:400-470"},["opening"]="Erelas considered the altar discovery important enough to share immediately. He sent the account to Fandral, expecting the archdruid to take the same interest.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to explain the discovery to Fandral.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the findings to Darnassus.",["sourceHash"]="0a09ee8041391a850a9085df32907f26a30ab3a3297e1518b6187964f0108d65",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4903]={["aftermath"]="Goretooth briefly went pale on receiving the report; the retained ending does not explain his reaction.",["atomIDs"]={"4903:description:1-94","4903:description:99-132","4903:description:137-183","4903:description:188-238","4903:description:243-320","4903:description:325-347","4903:description:352-373","4903:objective:1-63","4903:objective:65-102","4903:objective:104-181"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4903:completion:1-77"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Omokk, Voone and Wyrmthalak and recover Blackrock documents.",["opening"]="Goretooth's written order targeted three leaders of the Spire's lower city and demanded important documents as well as their destruction. The mission joined attacks on the command hierarchy to an intelligence-gathering purpose.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront the three leaders and recover their documents.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the leaders' defeat and delivered the Blackrock documents.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="8d7774918ec73779f1afa2b9853045f8750256dbbc2e8215a8896063e335ec63",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
