[4982]={["aftermath"]="Bijou believed the plans would make Lexlort forget his anger with her.",["atomIDs"]={"4982:description:1-166","4982:description:171-220","4982:description:222-271","4982:description:273-314","4982:description:316-360","4982:description:362-404","4982:description:406-434","4982:description:439-490","4982:description:492-502","4982:objective:1-47","4982:objective:49-128"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4982:completion:1-15","4982:completion:17-108","4982:completion:113-131"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Bijou's hidden reconnaissance gear from the lower city.",["opening"]="Bijou claimed she had been gathering military intelligence at night when a tripwire exposed her. She hid the equipment before fleeing, and heavier patrols now kept her from retrieving the report that might restore her standing.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover Bijou's stashed belongings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the reconnaissance gear to Bijou.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="866c1e2b10e101c9baba9018a8b785fc27e5e9a15cb93cc4ed4947b48f20d8c0",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4983]={["aftermath"]="Lexlort acknowledged the reports' strategic value, accepting that Bijou had found another way out of trouble.",["atomIDs"]={"4983:description:1-33","4983:description:35-93","4983:description:95-143","4983:description:148-161","4983:description:163-195","4983:description:197-251","4983:objective:1-74"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4983:completion:1-92","4983:completion:94-175","4983:completion:180-230"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Carry Bijou's reconnaissance report to Lexlort in Kargath.",["opening"]="Bijou trusted her intelligence to redeem her name and improve the expedition's position against the Blackrock orcs. She refused to leave her work, sending the report ahead instead of returning in custody.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry Bijou's report to Lexlort.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Bijou's reconnaissance report.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="675d7b2061b62d6f823b4d8e4ac62d4d1b0203fd3297d92d5f3ae3c5e5109bb4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4984]={["aftermath"]="The druid sensed rest for the wolves' souls and asked for further aid.",["atomIDs"]={"4984:description:1-140","4984:description:143-241","4984:description:244-298","4984:description:303-383","4984:description:386-435","4984:description:438-500","4984:objective:1-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4984:completion:6-76","4984:completion:78-125","4984:completion:130-204","4984:completion:206-242"},["opening"]="Mulgris came to heal nature rather than fight the Scourge alone. Faced with wolves he considered beyond salvation, he asked for release from their plague-driven suffering.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to end the suffering of eight diseased wolves.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Mulgris's wolf assignment.",["sourceHash"]="58bb9f191b6c7d78e6cc273953564035480416892eb2cb318abbc6e6d9600a4a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4985]={["aftermath"]="Mulgris said their torment had ended, entrusted a message carved on a branch, then fell motionless after a final sigh.",["atomIDs"]={"4985:description:1-128","4985:description:131-195","4985:description:198-309","4985:description:314-354","4985:description:357-449","4985:objective:1-110"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4985:completion:1-70","4985:completion:77-106","4985:completion:108-128","4985:completion:130-199","4985:completion:204-212","4985:completion:214-230","4985:completion:232-256","4985:completion:258-304","4985:completion:306-322","4985:completion:327-419","4985:completion:421-466"},["opening"]="The grizzlies eastward had suffered the same plague, their bodies stiffening and decaying. Mulgris turned his appeal toward these once-majestic animals as his own strength failed.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront eight diseased grizzlies.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the grizzly assignment for Mulgris.",["sourceHash"]="bde2cfe19f19ca5f1ed67844a9322280b4ea84fef9ef5926abed479542b255bc",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4986]={["aftermath"]="Mathrengyl found valuable plague information in the gift and promised the Circle would use it.",["atomIDs"]={"4986:description:1-91","4986:description:94-170","4986:description:175-258","4986:description:261-399","4986:description:402-491","4986:objective:1-152","4986:objective:155-198"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4986:completion:1-7","4986:completion:9-30","4986:completion:32-166","4986:completion:168-268","4986:completion:270-314","4986:completion:316-398","4986:completion:403-482"},["opening"]="The dead druid's hand held a healthy branch warm with magic. Its glyphs suggested a destination in Darnassus and the Cenarion Circle, preserving the next step Mulgris could no longer take.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the branch to Darnassus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Mathrengyl.",["sourceHash"]="6f6e591101cea4255eb9681588725f2115d885f625af103dcfd3f83205cedbb6",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[4987]={["aftermath"]="Nara mourned her friend and said the branch held knowledge of the plague that would be studied diligently.",["atomIDs"]={"4987:description:1-91","4987:description:94-170","4987:description:175-258","4987:description:261-405","4987:description:408-497","4987:objective:1-156","4987:objective:159-202"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"4987:completion:1-30","4987:completion:32-143","4987:completion:145-163","4987:completion:165-177","4987:completion:179-196","4987:completion:198-229","4987:completion:234-293","4987:completion:295-384","4987:completion:386-413","4987:completion:415-445","4987:completion:447-495"},["opening"]="Mulgris's branch retained warmth and druidic glyphs beside his lifeless body. This route's enchantment pointed toward Elder Rise and the Circle's members in Thunder Bluff.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the branch to Thunder Bluff.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Nara.",["sourceHash"]="7c14f43e03ba914e327b24195d789363cb410ecbf47d9f4ade2acf3a208f324c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5001]={["aftermath"]="The recovery surprised Bijou, who immediately wanted to know where the belongings had been found.",["atomIDs"]={"5001:description:1-94","5001:description:96-161","5001:description:163-254","5001:description:256-361","5001:description:366-487","5001:description:492-496","5001:objective:1-47","5001:objective:49-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5001:completion:1-13","5001:completion:15-31"},["opening"]="Bijou was stranded with intelligence about a threat larger than the Blackrock orcs. Though her mission served the Horde, she offered information useful to the Alliance in return for her missing belongings.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Bijou's belongings and bring them back.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} recovered Bijou's belongings and returned them to her.",["sourceHash"]="a6c0fcd1bcfcb9df35aa54c23f2b1c8636860b6f794bfc6d8d7f4b2b7adee663",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5002]={["aftermath"]="Maxwell found that the intelligence agreed with much already known. He considered the map's marked positions valuable for further attacks on Blackrock.",["atomIDs"]={"5002:description:1-28","5002:description:30-48","5002:description:53-147","5002:description:152-217","5002:description:219-307","5002:description:312-367","5002:description:369-435","5002:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5002:completion:1-49","5002:completion:51-115","5002:completion:120-197"},["opening"]="Bijou identified Nefarian as the power behind the Blackrock orcs. Her map marked his subordinates within the citadel, and Marshal Maxwell was to receive the intelligence in the Burning Steppes.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Bijou's marked map to Marshal Maxwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Bijou's information to Maxwell.",["sourceHash"]="525b8689d4648cbdd9f5306529bd0b3c993ad25ce8cd5e22236a3e9fa6c69247",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5021]={["aftermath"]="A parcel in the barn stood out from the surrounding decay as the likely object of Janice's plea.",["atomIDs"]={"5021:description:1-33","5021:description:35-69","5021:description:74-157","5021:description:160-219","5021:description:222-319","5021:description:324-359","5021:description:362-395","5021:description:398-429","5021:description:432-464","5021:description:466-483","5021:objective:1-81","5021:objective:84-127","5021:objective:130-232"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5021:completion:1-105","5021:completion:107-186"},["opening"]="Janice's apparition repeated an urgent demand for delivery while barely recognizing the house around her. She remembered leaving a package by her horse but could not clearly explain where it should go.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find the ghost's abandoned package.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} located the package.",["sourceHash"]="44071932fd6301bd4392a7cc99e263d0bb4bc97d45ef55da9bdd99f5d0869bd8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5022]={["aftermath"]="An older census placed Emma in the city without proving she remained; Bathrilor then wondered whether she was Ol' Emma.",["atomIDs"]={"5022:description:1-91","5022:description:94-227","5022:description:232-373","5022:description:376-441","5022:objective:1-87","5022:objective:90-144"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5022:completion:1-40","5022:completion:42-90","5022:completion:92-114","5022:completion:119-205","5022:completion:207-334","5022:completion:336-383","5022:completion:388-403","5022:completion:405-452"},["opening"]="The dusty package bore Emma's Stormwind address and a date more than four years old. The census offered a way to look for its recipient without assuming she still lived there.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask the Royal Factors about Emma.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the inquiry to Bathrilor.",["sourceHash"]="160ee784c0ee4a8bb81bdaefc38d3adae44c4bb36f6bb44cd8679246fa5cfe10",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5023]={["aftermath"]="Bauhaus identified Jeremiah's changed surname as Payson and recalled the cockroach vendor.",["atomIDs"]={"5023:description:1-91","5023:description:94-230","5023:description:235-401","5023:description:404-471","5023:objective:1-96","5023:objective:99-175"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5023:completion:1-78","5023:completion:80-110","5023:completion:115-166","5023:completion:168-314","5023:completion:316-403","5023:completion:408-423","5023:completion:425-454"},["opening"]="This package named Jeremiah in pre-plague Lordaeron. More than four years of delay made his survival uncertain, leaving Undercity census records as the next lead.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to consult Bauhaus about Jeremiah.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the old address to the overseer.",["sourceHash"]="58023c251fc39e12098b2946fd7415a2cc9af8439533b82e7d71502de1e9b7c3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5041]={["atomIDs"]={"5041:description:1-68","5041:description:73-267","5041:description:269-372","5041:description:377-427","5041:objective:1-66"},["opening"]="The caravan's lost cargo had been urgently needed at the Crossroads. Thork sought crates from the Razormane camps to restore those supplies.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the Crossroads' supply crates.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the lost supplies to Thork.",["sourceHash"]="92febf823c10f51f549fc7b764e9bd724759270eb6f557b0723253d4abf02ed1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5047]={["aftermath"]="Malyfous greeted the news of Finkle's survival, the working suit, and the strange material with astonishment.",["atomIDs"]={"5047:description:1-48","5047:description:50-114","5047:description:119-137","5047:description:142-185","5047:description:190-249","5047:description:254-366","5047:description:371-425","5047:description:427-458","5047:objective:1-40"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5047:completion:1-6","5047:completion:8-19","5047:completion:21-45"},["opening"]="Finkle sent word to Malyfous that he had survived and that the suit had worked. A glowing piece of flesh taken from the beast's innards accompanied the message, offering the craftsman something to assess.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Malyfous in Everlook with Finkle's message and sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.",["sourceHash"]="5eae3889c7060dabe160b642159107032e39e308336822184a8c4dbb7d6266e1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5048]={["aftermath"]="Emma confirmed the Felstone name and recognized the connection to her sister. The news brought memories of plague losses into an encounter she had first received with suspicion.",["atomIDs"]={"5048:description:1-58","5048:description:60-151","5048:description:156-264","5048:description:267-344","5048:description:349-422","5048:description:425-481","5048:objective:1-67","5048:objective:70-145"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5048:completion:1-83","5048:completion:85-90","5048:completion:92-103","5048:completion:108-126","5048:completion:128-138","5048:completion:140-158","5048:completion:160-197","5048:completion:199-269","5048:completion:271-298","5048:completion:300-308","5048:completion:310-350","5048:completion:352-393","5048:completion:395-423","5048:completion:428-434","5048:completion:436-476"},["opening"]="The records made Bathrilor think Stormwind's wandering Ol' Emma might be Emma Felstone. Confirming the surname could place Janice's package with the person for whom it was made.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to ask Ol' Emma whether she was Emma Felstone.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the identity-and-package inquiry with Ol' Emma.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="c899534d31d377f5d766f48d8e7c2b7ec2530b52f4eff90c99c8df66428b832b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5049]={["aftermath"]="Jeremiah confirmed the old surname and his dead sister's identity, then reacted with suspicion before hearing of her package.",["atomIDs"]={"5049:description:1-155","5049:description:160-230","5049:description:232-243","5049:description:246-303","5049:description:306-354","5049:description:357-498","5049:objective:1-81","5049:objective:84-157"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5049:completion:1-36","5049:completion:38-124","5049:completion:129-164","5049:completion:166-210","5049:completion:215-230","5049:completion:235-249","5049:completion:254-361","5049:completion:363-399","5049:completion:404-411","5049:completion:413-453"},["opening"]="Bauhaus's records pointed to the cockroach vendor as the recipient under a changed surname. The old parcel still required personal confirmation before it could be given to the right man.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Payson about his former name.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Jeremiah Payson.",["sourceHash"]="e501298f0e73ea610189c723ab137a752fc2d5a701bc901609cc0adda6070326",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5050]={["aftermath"]="Janice mistook the bearer for John and demanded the other half before they could be together.",["atomIDs"]={"5050:description:1-79","5050:description:82-187","5050:description:190-234","5050:description:239-315","5050:description:317-345","5050:description:348-427","5050:description:432-499","5050:objective:1-74"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5050:completion:1-47","5050:completion:49-89","5050:completion:94-142","5050:completion:144-191","5050:completion:193-200","5050:completion:202-217"},["opening"]="Janice's sibling returned half of her charm after receiving the personal effects. Its return might let the tethered spirit know that the delivery was complete.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the half-charm back to Janice.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the charm half.",["sourceHash"]="ceaec94f121a785127d33715b2e275dd27bae0c6d6aa8a2cba93af3b1e30e461",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5051]={["aftermath"]="Janice's form changed and her gaze cleared. She declared herself freed and relinquished the charm.",["atomIDs"]={"5051:description:1-41","5051:description:46-64","5051:description:67-109","5051:description:112-182","5051:description:185-207","5051:description:209-231","5051:description:234-253","5051:description:258-392","5051:objective:1-117","5051:objective:122-207"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5051:completion:1-68","5051:completion:70-141","5051:completion:143-217","5051:completion:222-240","5051:completion:242-274","5051:completion:276-348"},["opening"]="Janice's plea now focused on her husband's half of the charm. Finding it somewhere on the farm and joining the pieces offered a possible answer to what still bound her.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to reunite the charm and give it to Janice.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the complete charm.",["sourceHash"]="b5c2431eab2b169d5e142350aa0c669c5a9f066d9a99e4a1469f31566b793152",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5052]={["aftermath"]="The shard renewed Mangletooth's sense of power, and his explanation turned toward the tribe that had abandoned him.",["atomIDs"]={"5052:description:1-124","5052:description:126-248","5052:description:250-256","5052:description:261-293","5052:description:298-364","5052:description:366-469","5052:description:471-477","5052:objective:1-66","5052:objective:71-148"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5052:completion:1-22","5052:completion:24-71","5052:completion:73-137","5052:completion:139-145","5052:completion:150-190","5052:completion:192-219","5052:completion:224-251","5052:completion:253-288","5052:completion:293-329","5052:completion:331-357","5052:completion:359-391","5052:completion:393-436","5052:completion:438-463","5052:completion:465-471"},["opening"]="Mangletooth described red stones touched by Agamaggan's blood and carried as Bristleback totems. One shard would demonstrate understanding; further shards could secure blessings.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Mangletooth a blood shard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a shard at Camp Taurajo.",["sourceHash"]="303b3e0f70bd177101c6f46c6296b8a0f7e58226365990fcd773305688668899",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5054]={["aftermath"]="Storm acknowledged the difficult task without yet granting full approval.",["atomIDs"]={"5054:description:1-93","5054:description:95-163","5054:description:168-194","5054:description:196-251","5054:description:253-303","5054:description:308-409","5054:description:411-429","5054:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5054:completion:1-45","5054:completion:47-105"},["opening"]="Storm named a bear whose cunning reversed many hunts. Ursius ranged northwest of Everlook, where an unguarded pursuer could become the prey.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to hunt Ursius.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the bear assignment.",["sourceHash"]="3302739ad1d755d023348847a82852ad8bd54a3f9a5841f6671b7aed84355aaa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5055]={["aftermath"]="Storm accepted a true adventurer's ability and opened his final request.",["atomIDs"]={"5055:description:1-96","5055:description:98-170","5055:description:172-239","5055:description:244-296","5055:description:298-333","5055:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5055:completion:1-4","5055:completion:6-23","5055:completion:25-71","5055:completion:73-165","5055:completion:170-208"},["opening"]="Brumeran's graceful flight concealed a lethal danger in southern Winterspring. Storm made the silent chimaera the next measure after the bear.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront Brumeran.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned after completing the hunt.",["sourceHash"]="cde34d8b7dbf0463b44839f9463d82dd5645233af219dd62346b3b849cbb7caa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5056]={["aftermath"]="Storm said he had taught what he could and left further challenges to the road ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"5056:description:1-93","5056:description:95-150","5056:description:152-253","5056:description:258-342","5056:description:344-391","5056:description:393-463","5056:description:468-505","5056:objective:1-75"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5056:completion:1-58","5056:completion:60-141","5056:completion:146-159"},["opening"]="The final hunt required summoning a frostsaber matriarch with meat from her own kin. Storm warned that the offering at her stone would draw anger rather than a quiet appearance.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to summon and confront the matriarch.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Storm's final hunt.",["sourceHash"]="621cf1b02ef3ef91000b1bc0c00d162a9811022630034156e62ecce1e27d4d9a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5057]={["aftermath"]="Melor honored the experience represented by the marker and the growth it signified.",["atomIDs"]={"5057:description:1-60","5057:description:62-203","5057:description:208-260","5057:description:262-337","5057:description:339-407","5057:description:409-502","5057:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5057:completion:1-39","5057:completion:41-144","5057:completion:146-185","5057:completion:190-332"},["opening"]="Storm's marker carried recognition to an older hunting teacher. Melor was to hear the recent victories, connecting the mountain trials with earlier accomplishments.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the marker to Melor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Storm's recognition in Thunder Bluff.",["sourceHash"]="cbedbef999f5966bb9f556dd81b788ead7d0f11ce22eaa1a24c68325d0117f58",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5062]={["aftermath"]="Magatha began enchanting the gathered herb to light the dormant fire.",["atomIDs"]={"5062:description:1-61","5062:description:63-162","5062:description:167-215","5062:description:217-321","5062:description:323-424","5062:description:429-491","5062:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5062:completion:1-63","5062:completion:65-158","5062:completion:163-209"},["opening"]="Motega named a sacred fire as the means to summon Arikara. Rare agave from the Boiling Pool first needed Magatha's enchantment in Thunder Bluff.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten bushels and consult Magatha.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the agave to Magatha.",["sourceHash"]="f1ca7777429ae7f3d2c7ede139b1d770be57a45e0ddff7ac5dfc608d5405b20c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5063]={["aftermath"]="Malyfous marveled at the successful collection and acknowledged the finished cap.",["atomIDs"]={"5063:description:1-30","5063:description:32-165","5063:description:170-280","5063:description:285-316","5063:description:321-351","5063:description:356-372","5063:description:377-402","5063:description:407-413","5063:objective:1-238","5063:objective:244-320"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5063:completion:1-11","5063:completion:13-66","5063:completion:68-106","5063:completion:111-128"},["opening"]="Malyfous's design promised a remarkable cap from an exceptional hide. Stitching, crystals, enchanted thread and a crafting fee completed the stated requirements.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather the cap materials and fifty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the hide, stitching, crystals, thread and fee.",["sourceHash"]="0499f67d0aee72bad9eca86a42ae5d603bc89fa3da0cf0c355302ed8a5e34ab7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5064]={["aftermath"]="The contents alarmed Longhorn and prompted him to begin preparations, without revealing a settled response.",["atomIDs"]={"5064:description:1-86","5064:description:88-135","5064:description:137-222","5064:description:224-308","5064:description:313-384","5064:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5064:completion:1-19","5064:completion:21-45","5064:completion:47-89","5064:completion:94-153"},["opening"]="Visitors of unknown origin had met secretly with the Grimtotem. Longhorn's intelligence placed three guarded messages in separate chests at Darkcloud Pinnacle.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover all three secret notes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered notes to Longhorn.",["sourceHash"]="6649b11206493fc8f7167af0712af3821c9c7a1e0576333eef586dbd28a775fd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5065]={["aftermath"]="Ironboot prepared to decipher them while identifying further work still needed.",["atomIDs"]={"5065:description:1-53","5065:description:56-166","5065:description:169-247","5065:description:250-253","5065:description:258-320","5065:description:325-370","5065:description:373-438","5065:description:440-471","5065:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5065:completion:1-15","5065:completion:18-23","5065:completion:28-41","5065:completion:44-99","5065:completion:104-137"},["opening"]="Ironboot challenged the account of the two tablets already recovered. His studies counted six, and he feared the remaining legend might change the meaning of containing Hakkar's essence.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the third and fourth tablets.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both tablets to Ironboot.",["sourceHash"]="324d16c5f42a50a7fae1bffa5ad9ed687a5918e50892e245eb2e97267f28342a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5066]={["atomIDs"]={"5066:description:1-17","5066:description:20-66","5066:description:71-129","5066:description:132-274","5066:description:277-343","5066:description:348-484","5066:objective:1-36","5066:objective:39-113"},["opening"]="Stormwind's crier called volunteers north against the Scourge. Rumors from the Plaguelands led the appeal to Valorfist's base at Chillwind Camp.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to report to Commander Ashlam Valorfist.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="3e05e67d65639dc573c8a12b5efa8d91cf1138842f3ea6a1983964e82f574dad",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5067]={["aftermath"]="Malyfous declared the improbable task completed and praised the resulting craft.",["atomIDs"]={"5067:description:1-137","5067:description:142-244","5067:description:249-281","5067:description:286-317","5067:description:322-336","5067:description:341-372","5067:description:377-383","5067:objective:1-235","5067:objective:240-316"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5067:completion:1-59","5067:completion:61-94","5067:completion:96-112"},["opening"]="The proposed leggings had never been successfully made, according to the design. Pristine hide, stitching, arcanite and embalming fluid offered the conditions for another attempt.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to assemble the leggings materials and fee.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the four-part collection and payment.",["sourceHash"]="6ac8baba59a303a67f05b373d90b8f122378514d5a3619f10acbb8c83a812df9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5068]={["aftermath"]="Malyfous welcomed an accomplishment he had scarcely expected to see.",["atomIDs"]={"5068:description:1-130","5068:description:132-184","5068:description:189-199","5068:description:201-274","5068:description:279-310","5068:description:315-345","5068:description:350-364","5068:description:369-388","5068:description:393-399","5068:objective:1-228","5068:objective:233-309"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5068:completion:1-64","5068:completion:69-143"},["opening"]="The account linked a unique breastplate to Garona but treated another as doubtful. Its proposed reproduction required an intact hide, stitching, metal and shadow skin at a substantial price.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather the breastplate materials and fee.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the required components and payment.",["sourceHash"]="30fdff52663a7151f3277abca2377728f9ca24aaa42d74f0072662ac3cd16725",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5081]={["aftermath"]="Maxwell judged the operation a success that had bought precious time.",["atomIDs"]={"5081:description:1-95","5081:description:100-131","5081:description:136-194","5081:description:196-266","5081:description:271-318","5081:description:320-388","5081:description:393-440","5081:description:442-511","5081:objective:1-96","5081:objective:98-144"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5081:completion:1-19","5081:completion:21-94"},["opening"]="Maxwell used the new intelligence to plan a strike against Blackrock's command. He named Voone, Omokk, and Wyrmthalak as leaders whose loss would disrupt the orcs, ogres, and citadel command.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat the three named leaders and report to Maxwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the defeat of Voone, Omokk, and Wyrmthalak to Maxwell.",["sourceHash"]="5bc17584c9a44f121936906bd7a1d5e19248e97463619ba3e98d1e997ad55744",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5082]={["aftermath"]="She prepared to resume study and asked whether anything interesting had been found.",["atomIDs"]={"5082:description:1-64","5082:description:66-128","5082:description:130-267","5082:description:272-322","5082:description:324-446","5082:description:451-504","5082:objective:1-128"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5082:completion:1-19","5082:completion:21-52","5082:completion:57-113"},["opening"]="Donova's spring research was blocked by Winterfall protectiveness around the water. The furbolgs' interest resembled her own, but she had not discovered why the springs were strange.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to reduce the three Winterfall groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Donova's camp assignment.",["sourceHash"]="96afdad2431b18ea8524f0519799251b3b3fd9a139a49740bfe40f652c4202c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5083]={["atomIDs"]={"5083:description:1-148","5083:description:153-178","5083:description:183-317","5083:objective:1-66"},["opening"]="The nearly empty flask held drops of a glowing green liquid. Its origin among the Winterfall offered a reason to show it to the researcher already watching the nearby springs.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the flask to Donova.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the firewater flask.",["sourceHash"]="c6f88ddb2034a54ea7d29ac430764ae1d18f83ce5bbc9cb273c4cd207bd0b4df",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5084]={["aftermath"]="A cauldron there bubbled with a foul, rotting substance.",["atomIDs"]={"5084:description:1-23","5084:description:25-95","5084:description:97-161","5084:description:163-233","5084:description:238-308","5084:description:310-387","5084:description:389-509","5084:objective:1-64"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5084:completion:1-70"},["opening"]="Donova compared the liquid to sludge from Felwood and recalled runners crossing the Hold. The Deadwood camp might provide evidence of trade rather than an answer inferred from resemblance alone.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to investigate the northern Deadwood camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the camp's clue.",["sourceHash"]="761791971ba6c8544e34c738dc2294d88db63858133431fd68a8233535076097",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5085]={["aftermath"]="Donova questioned whether the Winterfall had visited the camp, leaving the route of contact under investigation.",["atomIDs"]={"5085:description:1-96","5085:description:98-177","5085:description:182-294","5085:description:299-410","5085:objective:1-49"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5085:completion:1-29","5085:completion:31-103"},["opening"]="The cauldron's green substance resembled the drops in the Winterfall flask. A sample could test the suspected connection and the fear that one tribe might follow another into corruption.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Donova the sample and findings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned from the Deadwood camp.",["sourceHash"]="878c6131629b8bf8d35e4e32906dc12564d4cff3d2c6e097229272ca8bece6b5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5086]={["aftermath"]="Donova prepared to compare them with the cauldron's liquid.",["atomIDs"]={"5086:description:1-122","5086:description:124-196","5086:description:201-392","5086:description:397-481","5086:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5086:completion:1-101"},["opening"]="Donova suspected toxic traces but refused certainty without comparison. Droplets from Irontree's corrupted elementals could show whether those creatures supplied the cauldron.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect three toxic droplets.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the comparison samples.",["sourceHash"]="d01c60104955c52cf0ed6a2837219b13632ffd3cb2269b8cdecce730a7fe8af4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5087]={["aftermath"]="She examined the contents and wondered whether consumption explained the furbolgs' size and aggression.",["atomIDs"]={"5087:description:1-23","5087:description:28-192","5087:description:194-306","5087:description:311-390","5087:description:392-463","5087:description:465-511","5087:objective:1-95"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5087:completion:1-43","5087:completion:48-118","5087:completion:120-146"},["opening"]="Tests showed the spring water removed toxicity while preserving temporary effects. Donova inferred a reason for the guarded springs and targeted the runners connecting the two tribes.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to stop the runners and their shipment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the interrupted shipment to Donova.",["sourceHash"]="f3ba3fb5b047954101e837b62c89066bb7adc01a61ff1eb5356973d48f472218",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5088]={["aftermath"]="Motega could not explain why Arikara would pursue Cairne, though he deferred to Magatha's judgment.",["atomIDs"]={"5088:description:1-106","5088:description:108-196","5088:description:201-291","5088:description:296-410","5088:description:412-447","5088:objective:1-13","5088:objective:15-116"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5088:completion:1-25","5088:completion:27-70","5088:completion:72-131","5088:completion:136-160","5088:completion:165-283"},["opening"]="Magatha's powder could summon Arikara at the burial needle's sacred fire. She feared the creature stalked Cairne, a suspicion the ritual was meant to address.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to summon Arikara and return proof to Motega.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Arikara's remains and the powder to Motega.",["sourceHash"]="ac0a01d2fd0fac3c2eab707f87b9653fc0ad62c212371806652c587788dfc159",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5089]={["aftermath"]="The letter deepened Maxwell's concern about the plot.",["atomIDs"]={"5089:description:1-166","5089:description:171-237","5089:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5089:completion:1-20"},["opening"]="A protocol letter from General Drakkisath lay among the remains of the defeated serpent. Its importance pointed toward Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Drakkisath's command letter to Maxwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the command letter to Marshal Maxwell.",["sourceHash"]="80674ccc2e5669e168eabcb244eea21230f688c1a89cfb021fdc1d0ab1f4d5fe",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5090]={["atomIDs"]={"5090:description:1-17","5090:description:20-66","5090:description:71-129","5090:description:132-274","5090:description:277-343","5090:description:348-484","5090:objective:1-36","5090:objective:39-113"},["opening"]="Hammerfall carried the kingdom's call for arms against northern undead threats. Volunteers were to find Valorfist beyond the Alterac Mountains, where Chillwind Camp gathered the response.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Commander Ashlam Valorfist.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0fec43f28749367a88cc9bd603a086cefc728805ba2b185ae2556c9b4ca95328",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5091]={["atomIDs"]={"5091:description:1-17","5091:description:20-66","5091:description:71-129","5091:description:132-274","5091:description:277-343","5091:description:348-484","5091:objective:1-36","5091:objective:39-113"},["opening"]="The herald repeated Stormwind's appeal against the Scourge and the new dangers rumored in the ruined north. Valorfist was the officer designated to turn that appeal into work.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek Commander Ashlam Valorfist.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Commander Ashlam Valorfist at his base camp.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="c944734d9fbe837e743b537151164322611e17c4b0e5f1656de43a3986f555b3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5092]={["aftermath"]="Valorfist prepared the next mission inside Andorhal itself.",["atomIDs"]={"5092:description:1-137","5092:description:140-234","5092:description:237-312","5092:description:317-383","5092:description:386-476","5092:objective:1-64","5092:objective:69-144"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5092:completion:1-25","5092:completion:28-52","5092:completion:57-136","5092:completion:139-217","5092:completion:219-275","5092:completion:280-288","5092:completion:291-302"},["opening"]="Valorfist chose the less defended eastern approach to Andorhal. The undead at Sorrow Hill formed a barrier that had to be reduced before the advance could reach the city.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to clear the flayers and ghouls at Sorrow Hill.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the approach assignment.",["sourceHash"]="988b64d0c4290c718c74a9f6d664afd075b7d2588cb6f4eccbcbedabce8d1e68",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5093]={["atomIDs"]={"5093:description:1-73","5093:description:78-176","5093:description:179-250","5093:description:253-358","5093:description:363-487","5093:objective:1-34","5093:objective:37-118"},["opening"]="Gorlach issued the Horde's call against threats rising east of the Undercity. Derrington's base at the Bulwark was the gathering point for those answering it.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to answer Gorlach's call at the Bulwark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Derrington.",["sourceHash"]="ee8ce77013050adb9a862c6b0a6812109fb2da68722ff707d5924ba717675bb4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5094]={["atomIDs"]={"5094:description:1-73","5094:description:78-176","5094:description:179-250","5094:description:253-358","5094:description:363-487","5094:objective:1-34","5094:objective:37-118"},["opening"]="Balthazad's summons directed able fighters toward the Plaguelands' rumored threats. Service began at Derrington's camp on the eastern edge of Tirisfal.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to report from Balthazad's summons.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the Bulwark's commander.",["sourceHash"]="73e38db36dc6ff54fefc7aa63763d268675aae0bd01dbe3ba628410ec0661fab",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5095]={["atomIDs"]={"5095:description:1-73","5095:description:78-176","5095:description:179-250","5095:description:253-358","5095:description:363-488","5095:objective:1-34","5095:objective:37-119"},["opening"]="Windstrider carried the call for swift action against the Scourge. The frontier beyond Tirisfal required recruits to meet Derrington before taking further orders.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Windstrider's answer to the Bulwark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented at Derrington's camp.",["sourceHash"]="5a7ec9065c7d6cacaf59028b92cf18a53da3941add6fb99c6a04cb1ddad13a2e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5097]={["aftermath"]="The priests reported strong signals from all four targets, completing preparations for the attack.",["atomIDs"]={"5097:description:1-130","5097:description:133-243","5097:description:248-329","5097:description:332-438","5097:description:441-508","5097:objective:1-128","5097:objective:133-258"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5097:completion:1-109","5097:completion:111-203","5097:completion:205-231","5097:completion:236-308","5097:completion:310-360"},["opening"]="Valorfist suspected four watchtowers directed Scourge troop movements. A limited-charge torch could mark them for later operations, provided its beacons were planted in the doorways.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to mark the four towers and return the torch.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Valorfist's tower assignment.",["sourceHash"]="99f8d844b28c2f42681fb3f964e3f5eb79a3ac32a851a8d23240d27bef2d20e7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5098]={["aftermath"]="Derrington's priests detected strong signals on every tower and judged the assault preparations in place.",["atomIDs"]={"5098:description:1-130","5098:description:133-243","5098:description:248-329","5098:description:332-438","5098:description:441-508","5098:objective:1-128","5098:objective:133-253"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5098:completion:1-109","5098:completion:111-203","5098:completion:205-231","5098:completion:236-308","5098:completion:310-360"},["opening"]="Derrington's beacon plan sought targets for the Horde's next assault. Five charges allowed little waste while breaching Andorhal to mark the four suspected command towers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to plant four beacons and return the device.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Derrington's tower assignment.",["sourceHash"]="bbbc93d65a1e7dcd28b6b2515ff424e398839c955af47c7fc48187d9e08bd296",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5102]={["aftermath"]="Maxwell praised the success and looked toward a future attack on the dragon lords.",["atomIDs"]={"5102:description:1-181","5102:description:183-206","5102:description:208-313","5102:description:318-362","5102:description:367-448","5102:objective:1-57","5102:objective:59-105"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5102:completion:1-55","5102:completion:57-97","5102:completion:99-116"},["opening"]="Maxwell described a war fought both within Stormwind and at Blackrock's doorstep. He ordered General Drakkisath's destruction as another strike against the forces that had attacked Alliance homes.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return to Blackrock Spire and defeat Drakkisath.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported Drakkisath's defeat to Maxwell.",["sourceHash"]="af268f34701ab38daa24ab731b20a124c1c17d365a089a3ef0beb3dfafe8b0f8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5103]={["aftermath"]="The sight of the gauntlets startled Malyfous.",["atomIDs"]={"5103:description:1-65","5103:description:67-153","5103:description:158-219","5103:objective:1-64","5103:objective:66-75"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5103:completion:1-11"},["opening"]="A charred human skeleton lay within reach of unfired plate gauntlets. The unfinished work had survived the fire, leaving the question of who could make use of it.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the gauntlets and seek someone who understood them.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the unfired gauntlets to Malyfous Darkhammer.",["sourceHash"]="471edcb036ac3cd72681128eb9e9105ad45660c273090316bae9325ac252c0bd",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5121]={["aftermath"]="Donova hoped to resume her studies without fear of ambush.",["atomIDs"]={"5121:description:1-171","5121:description:176-335","5121:description:337-472","5121:description:477-508","5121:objective:1-73"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5121:completion:1-22","5121:completion:24-94","5121:completion:96-126"},["opening"]="The reason for drinking remained poorly understood. Donova inferred orders from the chief behind the tribe's changed behavior and hoped his defeat would prevent worse damage, without promising to reverse what had happened.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the Winterfall chief.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment.",["sourceHash"]="b4fe798441bb1ab5b026b0a83473209f37ed402fc68ce795be2a1cd4000bc033",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5123]={["aftermath"]="Donova could make nothing of their meaning.",["atomIDs"]={"5123:description:1-141","5123:description:143-245","5123:description:250-308","5123:objective:1-64"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5123:completion:1-34","5123:completion:36-63"},["opening"]="The chief's extensive log was written so crudely that its meaning could not be read. It offered a possible final lead if Donova could decipher it.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring her the log.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the chief's writings.",["sourceHash"]="2c2534b043183176ff28bf160fe35fb2677206b19300eb2e7a8d06bbe63046a9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5124]={["aftermath"]="Malyfous supplied the promised recipe after receiving the required parts.",["atomIDs"]={"5124:description:1-22","5124:description:27-50","5124:description:55-106","5124:description:108-159","5124:description:164-186","5124:description:188-275","5124:description:277-366","5124:description:371-389","5124:description:394-506","5124:objective:1-89","5124:objective:91-149"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5124:completion:1-36","5124:completion:38-130","5124:completion:132-173"},["opening"]="Malyfous wanted the unfired gauntlets and offered instruction in return. More components would let him establish an exact recipe, while he supplied ordinary thorium himself.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather the listed components and turn in the gauntlets.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the gauntlet-and-material exchange.",["sourceHash"]="4a2ffc8ad1db4f5e7cf67e9b2e8d54a1624031e91f9b7c6824f2490f29f4f9ad",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5126]={["atomIDs"]={"5126:description:1-43","5126:description:45-72","5126:objective:1-17","5126:objective:19-47"},["opening"]="Lorax paced and spoke to himself. The opportunity here was an account to hear from the satyr, rather than a new object to recover or enemy to confront.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to listen to Lorax.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} heard the satyr's story.",["sourceHash"]="b687d5f26fd0b60f3e39985135b4e4ee106b4a9f54f5bb6dc602658ac1de5740",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5127]={["aftermath"]="Lorax accepted that the pact had been kept and declared that he had taken the soul.",["atomIDs"]={"5127:description:1-70","5127:description:75-114","5127:description:116-171","5127:description:173-259","5127:description:261-304","5127:description:306-423","5127:objective:1-54","5127:objective:56-116","5127:objective:118-181","5127:objective:186-242","5127:objective:247-347"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5127:completion:1-27","5127:completion:29-48","5127:completion:50-73"},["opening"]="Lorax demanded the soul Goraluk Anvilcrack had bargained away and the breastplate he had stolen. A fel-imbued pike would draw the soul from the dead smith, securing Lorax's promised teaching.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat Goraluk and return the soul-stained pike and stolen breastplate.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Soul Stained Pike and Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax.",["sourceHash"]="ba1a1f3bcf1c41949f83ddbc346457641910ddd82a925cdea5c10fee686a8d2c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5128]={["aftermath"]="Kelek thought translation might be possible and asked for time before sending further word.",["atomIDs"]={"5128:description:1-198","5128:description:203-342","5128:description:347-449","5128:description:454-474","5128:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5128:completion:1-85","5128:completion:90-121","5128:completion:126-189","5128:completion:194-232","5128:completion:234-283"},["opening"]="Donova no longer faced the immediate threat but still could not explain the log. Kelek's experience with Felwood furbolgs offered another scholarly route into the firewater mystery.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the log to Kelek.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it in southern Felwood.",["sourceHash"]="d6d5949820c520cc9d7c1b543b1720990b30e9b985bb29a4eded2986aaaa67e8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5141]={["aftermath"]="Peter acknowledged the commitment and offered continued instruction in dragonscale work.",["atomIDs"]={"5141:description:1-68","5141:description:71-163","5141:description:168-316","5141:description:319-396","5141:description:399-499","5141:objective:1-111","5141:objective:116-197","5141:objective:202-373"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5141:completion:1-96","5141:completion:98-205","5141:completion:210-341"},["opening"]="Peter Galen required proof of scorpid armor work and a supply of dragonkin scales before teaching his specialty. Choosing that path meant forgoing the elemental and tribal traditions under his stated terms.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Peter two breastplates, two pairs of gloves, and ten worn dragonscales.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Peter Galen with the requested scorpid armor and dragonscales.",["sourceHash"]="173a87ea93ca986b0590b0603e172c039a0b46c39418dfce07a8ee824cf3e147",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5142]={["atomIDs"]={"5142:description:1-48","5142:description:51-65","5142:description:67-76","5142:description:81-164","5142:description:167-242","5142:description:247-262","5142:description:265-310","5142:description:313-358","5142:objective:1-20"},["opening"]="Marlene remembered hiding her niece as Darrowshire's battle began. Now a wandering spirit, she still did not know what had become of the child left behind.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to search Darrowshire for Pamela.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Pamela.",["sourceHash"]="4c3fac908884e7eccff2ae3d537c61cf1f1ca8b64da61e4bd5f014a24be3c6de",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5143]={["aftermath"]="Caryssia accepted the offerings and promised further teaching in the tribal art.",["atomIDs"]={"5143:description:1-206","5143:description:211-370","5143:description:373-443","5143:description:446-484","5143:objective:1-86","5143:objective:91-167","5143:objective:172-348"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5143:completion:1-93","5143:completion:95-176","5143:completion:181-312"},["opening"]="Caryssia Moonhunter regarded mastery of wild leather as preparation for a deeper understanding of primal nature. She wanted a vest and helmet before beginning a specialty that excluded the other two traditions.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to present Caryssia with a Wild Leather Vest and Helmet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the wild leather pieces to Caryssia Moonhunter.",["sourceHash"]="3f813b9db81d72dc717179fc7e82074a80cb9db6a8d3f4f14c27ed8e4a9ffbe3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5144]={["aftermath"]="Sarah accepted the choice and made further elemental instruction available.",["atomIDs"]={"5144:description:1-161","5144:description:166-322","5144:description:325-486","5144:objective:1-112","5144:objective:117-196","5144:objective:201-374"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5144:completion:1-50","5144:completion:52-149","5144:completion:154-285"},["opening"]="Sarah Tanner offered to teach the powers of elemental substance. Two pure essences from each of fire, water, earth, and wind would demonstrate readiness for a choice that excluded the other leatherworking specialties.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather Sarah's eight elemental materials.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Sarah Tanner the requested hearts, globes, cores, and breaths.",["sourceHash"]="462c4a750d5e15fe54df25751fe0bca09f6a195e75d8304b6c09da807adc984b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5145]={["aftermath"]="Thorkaf recognized the decision and offered to teach further dragonscale techniques as needed.",["atomIDs"]={"5145:description:1-68","5145:description:71-163","5145:description:168-316","5145:description:319-396","5145:description:399-499","5145:objective:1-122","5145:objective:127-208","5145:objective:213-384"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5145:completion:1-96","5145:completion:98-205","5145:completion:210-341"},["opening"]="Thorkaf Dragoneye wanted both accomplished scorpid work and the ability to acquire dragonkin scales. His offer carried a firm choice: dragonscale training would close the elemental and tribal paths.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Thorkaf two scorpid breastplates, two pairs of gloves, and ten dragonscales.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the required scorpid armor and scales to Thorkaf.",["sourceHash"]="5be377258a9f9d07d4ed86ceeed5f9e5b0e8381aff207fbb208347e3086219f0",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5146]={["aftermath"]="Brumn accepted the commitment to elemental leatherworking and offered continued training in the art.",["atomIDs"]={"5146:description:1-161","5146:description:166-322","5146:description:325-486","5146:objective:1-123","5146:objective:128-207","5146:objective:212-385"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5146:completion:1-50","5146:completion:52-149","5146:completion:154-285"},["opening"]="Brumn Winterhoof sought proof of an affinity with nature's elements. Fire, water, earth, and wind each had to contribute their pure substance before the elemental path could begin.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Brumn two of each requested elemental material.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Brumn with the hearts of fire, globes of water, cores of earth, and breaths of wind.",["sourceHash"]="f876de65e34dc07e437f40c2b5d6bbd8bffcc88c90866028a2da71ebd5f5d2af",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5147]={["atomIDs"]={"5147:description:1-23","5147:description:28-103","5147:description:105-191","5147:description:196-257","5147:description:259-357","5147:objective:1-92"},["opening"]="The notice accused Arnak of murder and kidnapping. His last reported location was the cliffs near Darkcloud Pinnacle, with proof required at Freewind.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to pursue Arnak's bounty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought proof of Arnak's defeat to Longhorn.",["sourceHash"]="1b4d2b368b63d2a20dc79c8a10e1aca6b3d4a4d64b56296e558027134c2e552e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5148]={["aftermath"]="Se'Jib accepted the work and promised further instruction grounded in primal nature.",["atomIDs"]={"5148:description:1-206","5148:description:211-370","5148:description:373-443","5148:description:446-484","5148:objective:1-84","5148:objective:89-165","5148:objective:170-346"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5148:completion:1-93","5148:completion:95-176","5148:completion:181-312"},["opening"]="Se'Jib offered the next stage of training to a maker already familiar with wild leather. A vest and helmet would be the final samples before choosing the tribal tradition over the other specialties.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring a Wild Leather Vest and Helmet to Se'Jib.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the wild leather armor to Se'Jib.",["sourceHash"]="45da519576230fb79a7ee90dfade9eaa937947698b626d45fe3be12c3ad6de8c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5149]={["aftermath"]="Pamela joyfully recognized the recovered toy.",["atomIDs"]={"5149:description:1-90","5149:description:93-139","5149:description:144-205","5149:description:208-309","5149:description:314-411","5149:description:416-444","5149:objective:1-19"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5149:completion:1-13","5149:completion:15-32","5149:completion:34-47"},["opening"]="Pamela waited where her aunt had told her to stay. Her father never returned to drive away the whispering visitors, and the doll left in town might provide company when darkness came.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Pamela's doll.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the doll to Pamela.",["sourceHash"]="82ce7b71b14eaa9115025c5cf32e3912ce40326fbe95291d989c33b3bfbef5b6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5151]={["aftermath"]="Wizlo still needed to discover what his recovered hypercapacitor actually did.",["atomIDs"]={"5151:description:1-62","5151:description:64-141","5151:description:143-146","5151:description:148-212","5151:description:217-244","5151:description:246-292","5151:description:294-366","5151:description:371-412","5151:objective:1-99"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5151:completion:1-18","5151:completion:20-92"},["opening"]="Wizlo survived the caravan's destruction, but his prized gizmo remained around a captive panther's neck. The centaur had left the dangerous animal alone.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the gizmo and return the cage key.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both items to Wizlo.",["sourceHash"]="cd7498fd65a6f171d832d713aa7b8fa9c45a4313502f0eaed5520c085ee7d31b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5152]={["aftermath"]="Marlene grieved the child's fate and could not bring herself to explain Joseph's fall to her.",["atomIDs"]={"5152:description:1-18","5152:description:21-39","5152:description:42-116","5152:description:119-131","5152:description:133-150","5152:description:155-193","5152:description:196-244","5152:description:247-273","5152:description:275-300","5152:description:305-315","5152:description:318-338","5152:description:341-374","5152:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5152:completion:1-15","5152:completion:17-27","5152:completion:29-42","5152:completion:52-63","5152:completion:65-107","5152:completion:112-166","5152:completion:168-186","5152:completion:197-244","5152:completion:246-305"},["opening"]="Pamela asked her new friend to seek the aunt who never came back. Marlene's house near Andorhal might offer news of her father and the family she missed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Marlene for Pamela.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Marlene south of Andorhal.",["sourceHash"]="5623bee13a0a4eb45f5909db17e2fb1d333c7df3b4d5c865e5f52ffabce89cc7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5153]={["aftermath"]="Chromie recognized tragedy around its former owner and proposed helping him in the past.",["atomIDs"]={"5153:description:1-68","5153:description:71-131","5153:description:134-150","5153:description:155-189","5153:description:194-241","5153:description:244-353","5153:description:356-383","5153:description:385-425","5153:description:430-502","5153:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5153:completion:1-13","5153:completion:15-29","5153:completion:31-43","5153:completion:52-143","5153:completion:148-172","5153:completion:174-205","5153:completion:207-246"},["opening"]="Marlene knew Joseph's soul had been twisted by the Scourge. His wedding ring beneath an empty monument offered a personal link to Chromie's unusual power over fate.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Joseph's ring to Chromie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the ring at Andorhal.",["sourceHash"]="708297736a76eeb3d51627722a71258f90d1a4878b564b10a3fd17cda291c2f3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5154]={["aftermath"]="The account described Joseph corrupted into the Scourge and betraying the defenders, a fate Chromie proposed trying to change.",["atomIDs"]={"5154:description:1-56","5154:description:59-147","5154:description:152-170","5154:description:173-221","5154:description:223-232","5154:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5154:completion:1-24","5154:completion:29-44","5154:completion:46-73","5154:completion:75-113","5154:completion:122-175","5154:completion:177-273","5154:completion:275-320","5154:completion:325-344","5154:completion:346-407"},["opening"]="Saving Joseph required learning what had happened before trying to alter it. Chromie sought Darrowshire's annals in Andorhal's city hall as the record of his past.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the annals for Chromie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the volume.",["sourceHash"]="b85ed32692c2b78ced56c520a70ca8a40bbaa569753fff7b37ec205898bda53c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5155]={["aftermath"]="Greta judged their reduced numbers an opening to press the enemy further.",["atomIDs"]={"5155:description:1-75","5155:description:80-188","5155:description:193-219","5155:description:221-272","5155:description:274-332","5155:description:337-422","5155:description:424-459","5155:description:461-503","5155:objective:1-154"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5155:completion:1-9","5155:completion:11-66","5155:completion:71-110","5155:completion:112-160","5155:completion:162-170","5155:completion:172-220","5155:completion:222-248","5155:completion:253-302","5155:completion:304-347"},["opening"]="Greta would trust only demonstrated opposition to the Shadow Council. Its Jaedenar dens offered a first test against the forces plotting with the Legion.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the four Jaedenar groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Greta's trial against the Council.",["sourceHash"]="c8a501ff11426aa12fa21fc4672f051cb4ab37d85693bdbc441a0aeb5d68a8ce",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5156]={["aftermath"]="The water was still corrupt, disappointing his hope of finding a pure source to ease the forest's healing.",["atomIDs"]={"5156:description:1-212","5156:description:217-246","5156:description:248-307","5156:description:309-409","5156:description:411-441","5156:description:443-506","5156:objective:1-96","5156:objective:98-220"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5156:completion:1-27","5156:completion:29-60","5156:completion:62-132","5156:completion:134-168","5156:completion:170-253","5156:completion:258-461"},["opening"]="Taronn wanted current knowledge of a war-scarred vale. Elementals and infernals still marked the old impact site, but the condition of its crater water remained a question to investigate.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to inspect the craters while confronting the entropic beings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Taronn's exploration report.",["sourceHash"]="5f3793f529db52f5cd18b6acea23a3b46339b4a469be294a8890cd058eab4aa5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5157]={["aftermath"]="Greta accepted the sample but required purification before it could be used on the braziers.",["atomIDs"]={"5157:description:1-86","5157:description:91-178","5157:description:180-294","5157:description:296-375","5157:description:380-464","5157:description:466-489","5157:objective:1-124"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5157:completion:1-24","5157:completion:29-114","5157:completion:116-184","5157:completion:189-221"},["opening"]="Protective braziers screened the Council's fortress from Greta's sight. A moonwell sample was the first preparation toward extinguishing them and learning who led the enemy.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to fill the canteen in Jaedenar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the corrupted water.",["sourceHash"]="5447af1f574656f2e381ac0a09687d5ff1d210c966c42cb978315ec5833319b2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5158]={["aftermath"]="Islen agreed the cause seemed noble but left the decision to purify it with the spirits.",["atomIDs"]={"5158:description:1-42","5158:description:44-142","5158:description:144-185","5158:description:187-252","5158:description:254-361","5158:description:366-430","5158:description:432-461","5158:description:463-507","5158:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5158:completion:1-52","5158:completion:54-175","5158:completion:177-262","5158:completion:267-317","5158:completion:319-371"},["opening"]="Greta trusted an old friend's bond with water spirits more than her own ability to cleanse the sample. The journey turned south to Islen's coastal camp in the Barrens.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the water to Islen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the corrupt sample.",["sourceHash"]="979df874e805df335547272e47dbc137e59f16101e40fc0d1a0333ac00019b21",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5159]={["aftermath"]="Greta found the amount sufficient and took the spirits' aid as encouragement for the plan.",["atomIDs"]={"5159:description:1-22","5159:description:24-76","5159:description:81-118","5159:description:120-170","5159:description:172-223","5159:description:225-259","5159:description:264-320","5159:description:322-335","5159:description:340-346","5159:description:348-382","5159:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5159:completion:1-55","5159:completion:60-107","5159:completion:109-173","5159:completion:175-254","5159:completion:256-348"},["opening"]="The spirits had supplied the purified water. Islen sent it back with respect for Greta's undertaking and a warning that the Council's danger exceeded an ordinary enemy.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return the cleansed water.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Greta.",["sourceHash"]="bd4d5bf822413c0bf403cc545f2ca92451b8eb3ce0a880a34e333c8f17972a88",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5160]={["aftermath"]="Haleh acknowledged the Aspects' rule against involvement in mortal affairs, while observing that one of their own had made distance difficult to maintain.",["atomIDs"]={"5160:description:1-23","5160:description:25-90","5160:description:92-148","5160:description:153-212","5160:description:214-320","5160:description:325-423","5160:objective:1-38","5160:objective:40-62"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5160:completion:1-62","5160:completion:64-194"},["opening"]="Awbee's scale could carry the blue dragon's experience beyond Blackrock. The cobalt runes beneath Mazthoril would provide passage to Haleh, who could read what Awbee had seen and felt.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek Haleh in Winterspring and give her Awbee's scale.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Awbee's scale to Haleh.",["sourceHash"]="b1982e859e21d67d865c150af06ef541f7a25163441c9a9496e77bb3e92405de",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5161]={["atomIDs"]={"5161:description:1-102","5161:description:107-226","5161:description:231-290","5161:description:295-335","5161:description:337-379","5161:description:381-446","5161:objective:1-41"},["opening"]="Haleh understood Nefarian's purpose but found the mountain's protection an obstacle to intervention. She offered power to a mortal ally only after that ally chose the perilous path knowingly.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to tell Haleh the decision to continue.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Haleh to proceed.",["sourceHash"]="f1b5827a78b87872280eb7e81bfb3f3320220fe54603e213521bd7b54771977c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5162]={["aftermath"]="Jeziba introduced his work as shaping heroes rather than statues.",["atomIDs"]={"5162:description:1-92","5162:description:97-139","5162:description:141-200","5162:description:205-281","5162:description:283-303","5162:objective:1-37","5162:objective:39-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5162:completion:1-43","5162:completion:45-96"},["opening"]="Haleh offered arcane transport toward a mortal counselor in Andorhal. Jeziba's wisdom and patience were the reasons she gave for the next stage of the journey.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Jeziba in the Plaguelands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Jeziba.",["sourceHash"]="81d7088c0fb2ff7742165ca5bd70baee5031e40f1646fb30912966dc61dcdf69",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5163]={["aftermath"]="Umi delighted in answering earlier mockery of her inventions.",["atomIDs"]={"5163:description:1-19","5163:description:24-113","5163:description:115-140","5163:description:145-302","5163:description:307-440","5163:description:445-486","5163:objective:1-57","5163:objective:62-95","5163:objective:98-128","5163:objective:131-174","5163:objective:179-235"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5163:completion:1-4","5163:completion:6-61","5163:completion:66-90","5163:completion:92-135"},["opening"]="The finished machine was ready for Umi's promised surprise. Three friends in widely separated towns were to receive visits before the borrowed yeti returned to its maker.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to frighten the three friends and return the machine.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the visits and returned Umi's yeti.",["sourceHash"]="967fb01c825dbd9be5a64a1e362c2e62438059111c05ce9be3cad1920b29b463",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5164]={["aftermath"]="Hundreds of pages were filled with garbled text and symbols.",["atomIDs"]={"5164:description:1-59","5164:description:61-118","5164:description:123-143","5164:description:145-181","5164:description:183-203","5164:description:205-225","5164:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5164:completion:1-100"},["opening"]="Jeziba directed study of the catalogue before further work. Persistence and survival, he said, would determine what its reader became.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the catalogue.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} examined the volume.",["sourceHash"]="0f6fb3df12a8f245d735e7662bd199fb0a90730f522cddfc7b18ca185d288421",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5165]={["aftermath"]="Greta saw inside when the last flame died and learned something before the warlocks renewed their spells.",["atomIDs"]={"5165:description:1-33","5165:description:35-98","5165:description:100-215","5165:description:217-253","5165:description:255-351","5165:description:353-415","5165:objective:1-174"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5165:completion:1-79","5165:completion:81-94","5165:completion:99-191","5165:completion:193-220","5165:completion:225-238","5165:completion:240-285"},["opening"]="Greta expected a brief opening before the Council could restore its protections. Dousing four scattered braziers would let her scry the fortress and identify its leader.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to quench all four protective flames.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the dousing and returned.",["sourceHash"]="173131719b2786e4a60293e1c9aab85aafefa5eeba12566623f355c2dbc04f65",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5166]={["aftermath"]="Jeziba treated the completed ordeal as the greater achievement and the breastplate as its reflection.",["atomIDs"]={"5166:description:1-129","5166:description:134-249","5166:description:251-332","5166:description:337-410","5166:description:415-463","5166:objective:1-125","5166:objective:130-150","5166:objective:155-184","5166:objective:189-207","5166:objective:212-244"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5166:completion:1-26","5166:completion:28-59","5166:completion:61-94","5166:completion:96-118","5166:completion:123-180","5166:completion:182-200","5166:completion:202-270"},["opening"]="The catalogue proposed armor built from the enemy's own scales and carapace. Blood from heroes and abomination stitching completed the demanding materials Jeziba would need to forge it.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather the four breastplate materials.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Jeziba with the required carapace, scales, blood and stitching.",["sourceHash"]="bcfffaf70a7deeb749e48a66e9369d3c71b2d7336e250d93564862ae11f141da",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5167]={["atomIDs"]={"5167:description:1-90","5167:description:92-192","5167:description:194-265","5167:objective:1-123","5167:objective:128-148","5167:objective:153-182","5167:objective:187-205","5167:objective:210-226"},["opening"]="The leggings' foundation was a mature drake's carapace layered with scales. Blood would enchant the frame, while skin of shadow lined its greaves.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather the four leggings materials.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the carapace, scales, blood and shadow skin to Jeziba.",["sourceHash"]="dc450049f72b8de46858f94935bdedee9f49c6066af112fad2be961a8eea8b2e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5168]={["aftermath"]="Carlin sensed their history would bring them together again through Darrowshire's fate.",["atomIDs"]={"5168:description:1-126","5168:description:131-237","5168:description:242-296","5168:description:299-439","5168:description:444-467","5168:description:470-505","5168:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5168:completion:1-35","5168:completion:40-159"},["opening"]="The annals linked two defenders' relics to the battle. Davil's libram was taken to Hearthglen, while Joseph's discarded shield lay near a barn, preserving different remnants of honor and betrayal.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the libram and shield.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought both relics to Carlin.",["sourceHash"]="6cf2974cc56892edc355b6180a5f9ca2cd5dde67f5278365bdd62be1d9e94ec8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5181]={["aftermath"]="Carlin felt a power he did not fully understand and memories of the village's final night.",["atomIDs"]={"5181:description:1-63","5181:description:66-163","5181:description:166-255","5181:description:260-340","5181:description:343-402","5181:description:407-431","5181:description:434-491","5181:objective:1-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5181:completion:1-15","5181:completion:17-30","5181:completion:32-117","5181:completion:122-232"},["opening"]="Carlin's search also required the battle's villains. Horgus's skull lay in a lake after his defeat; Marduk survived, but his broken sword had been lost in a gorge.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the skull and shattered sword.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both dark relics to Carlin.",["sourceHash"]="f647db93e6b0eb22fadf462e41207796cd9970ad4d4cca82a7c86512211ab3d9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5201]={["aftermath"]="Rivern expected only a short respite from intrusion and acknowledged continued perseverance.",["atomIDs"]={"5201:description:1-39","5201:description:41-141","5201:description:146-250","5201:description:252-370","5201:description:375-439","5201:description:441-497","5201:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5201:completion:1-104","5201:completion:109-156"},["opening"]="Rivern said he had never attacked the Winterfall, yet watched their fear and rage kill passing creatures. He sought a buffer around Frostsaber Rock rather than claiming their hostility began with his own hunt.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront five shamans and five ursa.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Rivern's defense assignment.",["sourceHash"]="95e62072591e1920989e6789add6d23312c16dff9619d78ff0a11550718d4712",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5202]={["aftermath"]="Arko recognized the key as her means of escape.",["atomIDs"]={"5202:description:1-65","5202:description:67-117","5202:description:119-177","5202:description:179-251","5202:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5202:completion:1-25","5202:completion:27-73"},["opening"]="The heavy red key seemed fashioned from fragile bone. Its presence with a Council member suggested a lock somewhere in Jaedenar still waiting to be found.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to discover the key's purpose.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the key to captive Arko'narin.",["sourceHash"]="ab8a38d89d2e38b9eca75a6413d97b0800eff4c1ec1ad35d95c29995fae57421",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5203]={["aftermath"]="Jessir confirmed Arko had passed with Lightforge, refusing even time for healing because her news was urgent.",["atomIDs"]={"5203:description:1-178","5203:description:180-199","5203:description:204-300","5203:description:305-403","5203:description:405-463","5203:description:468-487","5203:description:489-510","5203:objective:1-119","5203:objective:121-214"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5203:completion:1-40","5203:completion:42-66","5203:completion:68-127","5203:completion:129-218","5203:completion:220-250","5203:completion:255-314","5203:completion:316-368","5203:completion:370-477"},["opening"]="Arko would not flee without her equipment and Trey's sword. Escape had to pass those possessions before she could report the urgency in Darnassus and send news to Jessir.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to protect Arko through recovery and escape.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the escort and reached Jessir.",["sourceHash"]="48dccadf67aa539f3f81101c12b4be472bc47574e0a4fdcea927b7baf9524d12",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5204]={["aftermath"]="The paladin's remains were gathered after his spirit had been released from suffering.",["atomIDs"]={"5204:description:1-42","5204:description:44-160","5204:description:162-299","5204:description:301-331","5204:description:336-404","5204:description:406-509","5204:objective:1-95"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5204:completion:1-175"},["opening"]="Jessir believed Arko's private strength concealed grief over Trey's torture and death. Returning to his torturer and gathering his remains offered one concrete act for the fallen friend.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront Rakaiah and find Trey.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Trey's remains after the assignment.",["sourceHash"]="079e1bf1023a3e88a473f6487abc45c60b2942fce7e581c361802c0b33f97550",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5206]={["aftermath"]="Carlin recognized their connection to his village despite not understanding how the magic would work.",["atomIDs"]={"5206:description:1-164","5206:description:169-230","5206:description:233-360","5206:description:363-395","5206:description:409-504","5206:objective:1-90"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5206:completion:1-15","5206:completion:17-26","5206:completion:31-183"},["opening"]="Chromie identified the recovered relics as parts of a spell still needing one reagent. Her crystal could distinguish skulls belonging to champions who actually fought at Darrowshire.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find five resonating skulls and return the crystal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the skulls and mystic crystal.",["sourceHash"]="dcfa45ab0c182c7ef7a2af55714d5574bcc6d044ffbada3945bab19768a0fe30",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5210]={["aftermath"]="Carlin found himself and Joseph in the added pages and called for the account's truth to be investigated.",["atomIDs"]={"5210:description:1-123","5210:description:126-216","5210:description:219-290","5210:description:295-327","5210:objective:1-82"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5210:completion:1-18","5210:completion:20-45","5210:completion:47-80","5210:completion:82-125","5210:completion:127-157","5210:completion:162-175","5210:completion:177-249","5210:completion:251-277","5210:completion:279-310","5210:completion:312-329","5210:completion:334-360"},["opening"]="Chromie's magic extended the annals beyond the battle. A new passage named Carlin as a survivor of Joseph's betrayal and sent the book toward the brother at Light's Hope.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the extended history to Carlin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the annals.",["sourceHash"]="953133e477055c82e1d1da0f0af65965fa9088178a0c07f7633e32cdd379f24a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5211]={["aftermath"]="Carlin welcomed rest for at least some of the village's tortured defenders.",["atomIDs"]={"5211:description:1-56","5211:description:59-117","5211:description:120-162","5211:description:167-226","5211:description:229-345","5211:description:350-460","5211:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5211:completion:1-78","5211:completion:80-215"},["opening"]="Carlin knew many fallen defenders now served the Scourge in altered bodies. Destroying those forms could free the villagers' souls from the servitude following their deaths.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to free fifteen Darrowshire spirits.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the freeing and reported to Carlin.",["sourceHash"]="eabf9de17fea88bc58db06798408a926269bf4aab547843ad8cda7fc0116a324",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5212]={["aftermath"]="Betina identified a change in the active agents' chemical structure and called for more data.",["atomIDs"]={"5212:description:1-89","5212:description:94-139","5212:description:141-276","5212:description:278-320","5212:description:325-349","5212:description:351-443","5212:description:445-490","5212:objective:1-86","5212:objective:88-160"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5212:completion:1-92","5212:completion:94-115"},["opening"]="Betina's studies contradicted the belief that the plague was weakening. Recently infected flesh from Stratholme would let her test the apparent growth in its potency.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect ten plagued flesh samples for Betina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought ten samples of plagued flesh from Stratholme to Betina.",["sourceHash"]="530420f207abee35879bdd379030bbc4123b6c60986e8fceb2c1774fbf52c80d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5213]={["aftermath"]="The material promised months of analysis. In thanks, Betina offered an Argent Dawn seal or rune that could serve in place of the standard commission.",["atomIDs"]={"5213:description:1-50","5213:description:55-105","5213:description:107-171","5213:description:173-247","5213:objective:1-46","5213:objective:48-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5213:completion:1-12","5213:completion:14-58","5213:completion:60-107","5213:completion:112-207","5213:completion:209-319","5213:completion:321-388"},["opening"]="Betina sent the investigation deeper into Stratholme. The Scourge drew power from its ziggurats, and information recovered there might explain the changing plague.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to search the ziggurats and return with new Scourge data.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Scourge data recovered in Stratholme to Betina.",["sourceHash"]="4565c505aa074dacf22c099e0a25ae2eca7252283883fd62ebdd85a94485259d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5214]={["aftermath"]="Smokey welcomed the long-missed tobacco.",["atomIDs"]={"5214:description:1-17","5214:description:19-40","5214:description:42-126","5214:description:128-247","5214:description:252-292","5214:description:294-339","5214:description:341-454","5214:description:459-478","5214:description:480-505","5214:objective:1-88","5214:objective:90-133"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5214:completion:1-48"},["opening"]="Smokey remembered Fras refusing to abandon his tobacco shop as Stratholme fell. He presumed the shopkeeper had perished, but hoped that a box of the prized tobacco might have survived.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search Fras's shop for a surviving box of tobacco.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} recovered Siabi's Premium Tobacco and brought it to Smokey.",["sourceHash"]="6d67e2183e116922c108e2f979bc9e61f88e315f9f5f908adde1323eeb949ec4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5215]={["aftermath"]="MacDonnell described counteragents and the need to open each western cauldron first.",["atomIDs"]={"5215:description:1-118","5215:description:121-222","5215:description:227-381","5215:description:384-499","5215:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5215:completion:1-66","5215:completion:69-159","5215:completion:164-297","5215:completion:300-427","5215:completion:432-507"},["opening"]="Valorfist counted four western cauldrons spreading plague, with four more eastward. Direct shutdown exceeded their power against Kel'Thuzad, so MacDonnell would coordinate an attempt to turn the mixture against its makers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to hear MacDonnell's sabotage briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted the high priestess.",["sourceHash"]="05ed4a687cd182b53c0c80599e02de56bb7e0c02ee8e22cb58f8b665cf929f92",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5216]={["aftermath"]="Bilemaw's key fit the panel, exposing the mixture and a spigot suitable for the sample bottle.",["atomIDs"]={"5216:description:1-120","5216:description:123-212","5216:description:217-296","5216:description:299-360","5216:description:363-502","5216:objective:1-97","5216:objective:100-156","5216:objective:159-272"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5216:completion:1-88","5216:completion:91-206","5216:completion:211-358"},["opening"]="MacDonnell chose the less experienced defenders at Felstone for the first attempt. A key believed held by the cauldron lord and an empty bottle were both necessary to obtain poison for analysis.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gain access to Felstone's cauldron.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the cauldron at Felstone.",["sourceHash"]="d1a39948ca912cf468b48edf87c3ed8158e449f7518c2904d6cbfc034c23e68b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5217]={["aftermath"]="MacDonnell expected Arbington's analysis to enable sabotage, but warned that repeated additions would be needed to sustain an advantage.",["atomIDs"]={"5217:description:1-107","5217:description:112-228","5217:objective:1-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5217:completion:1-139","5217:completion:142-251","5217:completion:256-386","5217:completion:389-491"},["opening"]="The poison sample filled the bottle sufficiently for study. It had to return to MacDonnell before a counteragent could be devised for this cauldron.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the filled Felstone bottle to camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sample.",["sourceHash"]="d7a530e61bbb02db728c1bd3e1c89bd78f4c5bfa7677c29d2145df39320fd8b7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5219]={["aftermath"]="The key vanished into its lock, leaving an open panel over ichor-filled tubes and a place to draw the sample.",["atomIDs"]={"5219:description:1-108","5219:description:111-212","5219:description:217-306","5219:description:309-383","5219:description:386-504","5219:objective:1-145","5219:objective:148-261"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5219:completion:1-129","5219:completion:132-218","5219:completion:223-370"},["opening"]="The second farm's cauldron contained its own distinct toxins. MacDonnell directed another key recovery and supplied a separate bottle rather than treating the first sample as sufficient.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to unlock the Dalson cauldron.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} gained access to the cauldron.",["sourceHash"]="4dfdb675fa710bca9241e3306d2d6bd03ba133e9b65e0d8fae01c96783193015",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}
